[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14461.11, "timestamp": "04:01:01", "text": "ええ、これはニンジャがやったんです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14465.189, "timestamp": "04:01:05", "text": "私の視聴者の一人。彼女はウサギの絵を描いた"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14467.99, "timestamp": "04:01:07", "text": "猫。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14470.229, "timestamp": "04:01:10", "text": "でも、そうですね、[笑い] 私は好きです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14473.691, "timestamp": "04:01:13", "text": "そこには「撫でた」と書いてある。わかった。ともかく、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14473.75, "timestamp": "04:01:13", "text": "[鼻を鳴らす]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14477.75, "timestamp": "04:01:17", "text": "えっと、こうしましょう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14482.07, "timestamp": "04:01:22", "text": "えっと、でも分離器はどうなるんですか？わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14496.229, "timestamp": "04:01:36", "text": "軽量なJavaScriptが無料で利用できます。 1660で実行できます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14497.83, "timestamp": "04:01:37", "text": "素晴らしい"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14506.07, "timestamp": "04:01:46", "text": "ええと、すごく軽いんです。わかった、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14508.79, "timestamp": "04:01:48", "text": "試してみます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14511.189, "timestamp": "04:01:51", "text": "えっと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14517.51, "timestamp": "04:01:57", "text": "だから、私はこのように使用したいのです"}]